{"words": [{"text": "شَهْرُ", "translation": "Month"}, {"text": "رَمَضَانَ", "translation": "(of) Ramadhaan"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِىٓ", "translation": "(is) that"}, {"text": "أُنزِلَ", "translation": "was revealed"}, {"text": "فِيهِ", "translation": "therein"}, {"text": "ٱلْقُرْءَانُ", "translation": "the Quran"}, {"text": "هُدًۭى", "translation": "a Guidance"}, {"text": "لِّلنَّاسِ", "translation": "for mankind"}, {"text": "وَبَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ", "translation": "and clear proofs"}, {"text": "مِّنَ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ٱلْهُدَىٰ", "translation": "[the] Guidance"}, {"text": "وَٱلْفُرْقَانِ ۚ", "translation": "and the Criterion"}, {"text": "فَمَن", "translation": "So whoever"}, {"text": "شَهِدَ", "translation": "witnesses"}, {"text": "مِنكُمُ", "translation": "among you"}, {"text": "ٱلشَّهْرَ", "translation": "the month"}, {"text": "فَلْيَصُمْهُ ۖ", "translation": "then he should fast in it"}, {"text": "وَمَن", "translation": "and whoever"}, {"text": "كَانَ", "translation": "is"}, {"text": "مَرِيضًا", "translation": "sick"}, {"text": "أَوْ", "translation": "or"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "on"}, {"text": "سَفَرٍۢ", "translation": "a journey"}, {"text": "فَعِدَّةٌۭ", "translation": "then prescribed number (should be made up)"}, {"text": "مِّنْ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "أَيَّامٍ", "translation": "days"}, {"text": "أُخَرَ ۗ", "translation": "other"}, {"text": "يُرِيدُ", "translation": "Intends"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "بِكُمُ", "translation": "for you"}, {"text": "ٱلْيُسْرَ", "translation": "[the] ease"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "يُرِيدُ", "translation": "intends"}, {"text": "بِكُمُ", "translation": "for you"}, {"text": "ٱلْعُسْرَ", "translation": "[the] hardship"}, {"text": "وَلِتُكْمِلُوا۟", "translation": "so that you complete"}, {"text": "ٱلْعِدَّةَ", "translation": "the prescribed period"}, {"text": "وَلِتُكَبِّرُوا۟", "translation": "and that you magnify"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "for"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "[what]"}, {"text": "هَدَىٰكُمْ", "translation": "He guided you"}, {"text": "وَلَعَلَّكُمْ", "translation": "so that you may"}, {"text": "تَشْكُرُونَ", "translation": "(be) grateful"}], "sahih": "The month of Ramaḍān [is that] in which was revealed the Qur’ān, a guidance for the people and clear proofs of guidance and criterion. So whoever sights [the crescent of] the month,1 let him fast it; and whoever is ill or on a journey - then an equal number of other days. Allāh intends for you ease and does not intend for you hardship and [wants] for you to complete the period and to glorify Allāh for that [to] which He has guided you; and perhaps you will be grateful."}